---
---

<section id="hero" class="pt-28 sm:pt-36 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="masthead-name hero-fade" style="--delay: 0.05s;">
      Facundo Cornejo<span class="masthead-dot">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="label hero-fade" style="--delay: 0.15s; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
      <span data-locale-es>Fullstack developer · Paraná, Argentina</span>
      <span data-locale-en class="hidden">Fullstack developer · Paraná, Argentina</span>
    </p>

    <div class="masthead-intro hero-fade" style="--delay: 0.28s;">
      <p>
        <span data-locale-es>
          Hago <strong>sistemas que atienden mostradores reales</strong>: un ERP
          para una tienda de suplementos, un punto de venta para un comercio de
          barrio, el catálogo de una concesionaria. Software que cobra ventas,
          cuida stock y responde preguntas — hoy, en el negocio de alguien.
        </span>
        <span data-locale-en class="hidden">
          I build <strong>systems that run real shop counters</strong>: an ERP
          for a supplements store, a point of sale for a neighbourhood shop, a
          car dealership's catalog. Software that charges sales, keeps stock
          honest and answers questions — today, inside someone's business.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <span data-locale-es>
          Me recibí en la UTN, trabajo freelance y en equipo, y me destaco en el
          relevamiento: traduzco cómo opera un negocio a software que lo
          resuelve. Esta página es un índice: todo lo que construí, en una sola
          lista. Tocá cualquier cosa y te lleva al fondo del asunto.
        </span>
        <span data-locale-en class="hidden">
          I graduated from UTN, work freelance and in teams, and my edge is
          discovery: I translate how a business operates into software that
          solves it. This page is an index: everything I've built, in a single
          list. Click anything and it takes you to the bottom of the matter.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .masthead-name {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: 0.005em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .masthead-dot {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .masthead-intro {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .masthead-intro strong {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import type { Locale } from '@i18n/store';

  function updateHeroLocale(locale: Locale) {
    const esElements = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('#hero [data-locale-es]');
    const enElements = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('#hero [data-locale-en]');

    if (locale === 'en') {
      esElements.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('hidden'));
      enElements.forEach((el) => el.classList.remove('hidden'));
    } else {
      esElements.forEach((el) => el.classList.remove('hidden'));
      enElements.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('hidden'));
    }
  }

  const initialLocale = (document.documentElement.lang || 'es') as Locale;
  updateHeroLocale(initialLocale);

  window.addEventListener('locale-change', ((e: CustomEvent<Locale>) => {
    updateHeroLocale(e.detail);
  }) as EventListener);
</script>
